Description: experimental live wallpaper manager for GNOME
 GnomeEngine provides a native application for importing and previewing local
 video backgrounds and controlling an external GStreamer renderer. Desktop
 placement uses an experimental GNOME Shell/Mutter bridge and requires GNOME
 50 or newer on Wayland with the GnomeEngine Shell extension enabled. This
 integration has not yet been runtime-validated on the target session.
